        "created_at": "2017-10-28T16:29:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just keeping track of all the food metaphors Christopher and Adam use in The Letters Page</p><p>The Void is jelly (American jelly, which is like a jam that has been strained?)</p><p>The Host are gelatin dessert (what <em>I</em> would call jelly). Or pudding.</p><p>Time and realities are boba tea, where the boba are timelines and the tea is the Sea of Time. Also one of the boba has a weird attachment of The Block on it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:21.357Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
